t messaging, reminders, and reviews.",[796],{"_286":154,"_294":797},"  Hospitality Booking questions, guest messaging, reminders, and reviews. ","Estate Agents Lead capture, viewings, feedback, and vendor follow-up.",[800],{"_286":154,"_294":801},"  Estate Agents Lead capture, viewings, feedback, and vendor follow-up. ","Each page gives you the most relevant pack, supporting guides, and a short explanation of where automation pays back fastest.",[805],"p.section-subtitle.industry-directory-shell__subtitle",{"_286":154,"_294":802},"Choose the industry page that matches your team.","h2.section-title.industry-directory-shell__title",[305,351,307,352,353],{"_302":252,"_154":837},[811,812,813,814,815,816],{"_286":279,"_152":246,"_302":252,"_154":837,"_274":304},{"_286":287,"_152":243,"_154":834,"_290":835,"_274":298},{"_286":287,"_152":240,"_154":830,"_290":831,"_274":819},{"_286":287,"_152":237,"_154":826,"_290":827,"_274":819},{"_286":287,"_152":234,"_154":822,"_290":823,"_274":819},{"_286":287,"_152":231,"_154":817,"_290":818,"_274":819},"04 Book Book the audit once you want the right first workflow mapped.",[820],"a.commercial-pathway__step",{"_286":154,"_294":821}," 04 Book Book the audit once you want the right first workflow mapped. ","03 Pricing Compare the exact module and bundle options in the atlas.",[824],{"_286":154,"_294":825}," 03 Pricing Compare the exact module and bundle options in the atlas. ","02 Industry pages Use the directory below to open the page that matches your team and buying intent.",[828],{"_286":154,"_294":829}," 02 Industry pages Use the directory below to open the page that matches your team and buying intent. ","01 Overview Stay here if you still need the broad picture of what Silverstone AI covers.",[832],{"_286":154,"_294":833}," 01 Overview Stay here if you still need the broad picture of what Silverstone AI covers. ","Start broad, open the industry page that matches your business, compare the pack and modules that fit, then book whe